# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit .env.local.
# Supabase dashboard > Project Settings > API Keys.
# Local (.env.local) uses the DEVELOPMENT project's URL and publishable key.
# The PRODUCTION project's values live only in Vercel. The two are separate databases.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
# The app signs organisers in and saves their tournaments with these two only.
# It does not use the secret key: never add it here or to any NEXT_PUBLIC_ variable.
